note dnote Ranger's camp note | OUTER CAMP 3 - LISE, Seedkeepers' search crew\n\nWe stopped here on the way in. The birds go quiet past the ridge. Bo tried whistling to them and the quiet got worse, which I did not know quiet could do.\n\nThe Seedkeepers say the green is waking up. Oda says it is hungry. Greta says it is both, like a baby, and Greta has five, so we listen to Greta.\n\nWe found the river people's lamps in the reeds, still lit, all in a row, set down very neatly as if they would be picked up again in a minute.\n\nKeep the fire small and the machete close. Keep the sandwiches closer.
place Caravan_Green_01 dvan at -38.5 6.1 ground yaw=77
prop dvan tint.color=#5a6b3a
prop dvan tint.amount=0.5
place Loot_ChestSmall dwreckchest at -42.5 9.1 ground sit yaw=17
note dwreckchest Overgrown chest | A chest the green has half swallowed: rope, nails and an old machete's whetstone.
loot dwreckchest Rope*3;Nail*8;Stone*3
prop dwreckchest loot.refill=0
