# --- DEEP 10-24 (one-hour pass: a climb, a dive, more to find; RAFT_ISLAND_DESIGN 0b): the drowned digger's west hill and its boom gantry (climb, zipline to the camp), the sunk pump barge (dive), the acid bog and its sinking log path (M7), the hummock beacon
# the west hill (STORY 10-24: no gantry tower or zipline - an optional walk up to the digger crew's survey cairn and
# its box; no quest step)
call vd_mount x=-66 z=-30 top=20 r=18 a0=60 turns=1.25 hb=3
