note bmbox Digger crew's box | SEEDKEEPERS - DIGGER CREW. We dug the channels the growth was meant to drink from. The pump barge drained the bog; it sank in the first storm.
loot bmbox Rope*3;Bolt*3;MetalIngot*1
prop bmbox loot.refill=0
