note bmcrate Pump barge's valve box | A brass bog-pump valve, greased and wrapped. Stamped on it: BOG PUMP.
loot bmcrate story:valve*1;Scrap*3;Bolt*2
# the acid bog (RAFT_QUEST_MECHANICS SL11 7, M7): a sunken bog of acid round a dead stump island with the burner's
# fuel drum; old logs lie across it and bob as you step on them. The pump at its edge takes the barge's valve and drains it;
# without the valve the camp's blight suit keeps the acid off for three minutes.
# M7 with the 10-24 mechanics: the bog breathes (zone.pulse) - the acid surges 5 s and ebbs 3 s, so a quick player can
# hop the logs in the ebbs; the logs bob (no sink-under-foot mechanic: EDITOR GAP).
brush flatten at 56 40 r=9 s=20 frames=150 h=0.8
