call vd_spot x=-10 z=71.5 al=bmheronz id=bm_heron r=3 msg="From the heron hummock the burnt roots smoke in a line across the marsh."

# --- STORY 10-24: Ranger log 7 at the marsh station, the dog-handler's note by the west root, Marit's sample tag at the east root
place Note_Paper rangerlog7 at 20 41.6 ground y=0.3 drop
note rangerlog7 Ranger log 7 | RANGER LOG 7 - O. FENN\n\nThe marsh station's sample jars line every shelf: grove soil, delta water, cave root, all labelled T.L. And one shelf of empty jars with names on them instead of places. HEDDA. ULF. LISE. GRETA. BO.\n\nI held the vial up against them. Same glass. Same hand.\n\nI am not calm any more. I said I would ask Teodor very calmly. I take it back.\n\nBurr found me in the reeds and stood on my foot until I stopped shaking. Good goat. Terrible goat. He has lost his bell; I have it in my pocket with the vial, which is getting crowded.\n\nThe burn crew's map says three roots. I will burn the first and see what the marsh does.
place Note_Paper dognote at -43.4 2.6 ground y=0.3 drop
note dognote Dog-handler's note | BO - SEARCH CREW\n\nThe dogs will not go near the hyena root. Good dogs, smart dogs, and they sit down in the mud and look at me like I have suggested something rude.\n\nThe hyenas came out of the reeds at dusk. Thin, wrong, too quiet. They did not want us. They wanted to drive us to the root, and stood in a ring round it like they were guarding a door.\n\nGreta says burn it. Lise says wait for the lab. I say whatever we do, do it before supper; I am not walking back through that in the dark.\n\nIf you read this, we waited for the lab.
place Note_Paper marittag at 54 -6 ground y=0.3 drop
note marittag Tag on the east root | A climbing tag, the kind you clip to a rope, wired to the root with care:\n\nM. FENN - SAMPLE LINE 40 - BOAR ROOT. GROWTH 1 METRE A DAY. TEODOR SAYS DO NOT CUT. I SAY SOMEBODY MUST.\n\nOn the back, scratched with a pin: ODA - IF YOU GET THIS FAR, I AM STILL UP AT THE HEART. I KEEP THE TOP BALCONY LAMP ON FOR YOU.

# --- Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest ----------------------------------------------------------------
info title=Blightmire
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A rotting marsh of black pools and grey stumps, where a purple growth covers three surfaced roots. Burn them in order. The seventh island of The Last Green World.
island on.arrive=message||Green fog over black water. The roots here have surfaced, and something purple grows on them.

story burnt|Root burnt|Note_Paper|A poisoned root of the marsh, burnt clean.

